    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "31064f7d_158ef344",
        "filename": "Documentation/config-gerrit.txt",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 1993,
      "author": {
        "id": 4069542
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-15T18:04:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I’d avoid making it an error. changeCleanup.query is intentionally “any valid change search expression,” so enforcing age: specifically would make the config less flexible.\n\n\u003e Seems like someone could do age:1minute if they really wanted a very minimal age criteria.\n\nsame could happen with abandonAfter",
      "parentUuid": "61fd01fc_5aac02d8",
      "revId": "f996123e1ca817eb02d752a0d63b5d10e2c12fb6",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a7e7a3c5_1885e2ed",
        "filename": "Documentation/config-gerrit.txt",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 1993,
      "author": {
        "id": 4069542
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-15T18:18:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "there are also other time based operators and we just can\u0027t confine to age.",
      "parentUuid": "31064f7d_158ef344",
      "revId": "f996123e1ca817eb02d752a0d63b5d10e2c12fb6",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
