      "lineNbr": 1993,
      "author": {
        "id": 3604707
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-15T21:31:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we shouldn\u0027t assume that an age criteria is ever desired (after all, we allow that to be turned off). Maybe there is some other weird criteria, or maybe there are different ages desired for different projects?",
      "parentUuid": "a7e7a3c5_1885e2ed",
      "revId": "f996123e1ca817eb02d752a0d63b5d10e2c12fb6",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e1817302_80ae1fdb",
        "filename": "Documentation/config-gerrit.txt",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 1993,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002666
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-19T19:22:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I think we shouldn\u0027t assume that an age criteria is ever desired (after all, we allow that to be turned off).\n\nIt was previously required. If you turned it off, you disabled the feature. I\u0027d like to relax that, but I\u0027m nervous about admins abandoning a ton of changes by accident. Keeping it as required, but potentially a \"no-op\" (i.e. admins could set a very short age), seems like a reasonable safety check.",
      "parentUuid": "4ef65986_a2ba6817",
      "revId": "f996123e1ca817eb02d752a0d63b5d10e2c12fb6",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ae321d50_6cf20ccb",
        "filename": "Documentation/config-gerrit.txt",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 1993,
      "author": {
        "id": 3604707
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-19T20:11:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think that logic really applies to this new feature. If you previously had an age requirement, it will still be there. I don\u0027t anticipate that someone would turn off the age requirement and then turn on this feature without one by accident. It certainly can happen, but it doesn\u0027t seem like any more of a footgun than the current age feature. We turned on the age requirement, and it was a bit of a disaster for us, so I understand the potential pain, but that pain is already potentially there, this feature doesn\u0027t make it new.",
      "parentUuid": "e1817302_80ae1fdb",
      "revId": "f996123e1ca817eb02d752a0d63b5d10e2c12fb6",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
