        "id": 1002666
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-19T20:40:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, fair. Let\u0027s tweak \"must\" then:\n```suggestion\nabandoned, so it should include an appropriate age constraint, e.g. `age:4w`.\n```",
      "parentUuid": "ae321d50_6cf20ccb",
      "revId": "f996123e1ca817eb02d752a0d63b5d10e2c12fb6",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
